<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14227" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">discrīmĭno</span></b> ,
			āvi, ātum, 1, v. a.
		discrimen, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to divide, part, separate</i> (very rare; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">divido, dispertio): aliquid,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 1, 23, 4</span></i>
			: Etruriam discriminat Cassia, * <i><span class="en">Cic. Phil.
				12, 9</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">late agros,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 11, 144</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crinem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Jud. 10, 3</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>to distinguish</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">notae, quibus inter se similia discriminentur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen.
					Ep. 95 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			 et saep.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">verba,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 9, § 104</span></i>
			 Müll.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>To divide, apportion</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vigiliarum somnique tempora,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					21, 4, 6</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
